# Copy this file to ".env.local" and paste your TMDB key after the = sign.
# Get one free at https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# Either the "API Key" (v3, short) or the "API Read Access Token" (v4, long) works.
#
# Note: in a React + Vite app this key is included in the JavaScript sent to the
# browser, so anyone can see it. That's normal for TMDB's free read-only keys.
VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=
